End point measurements were converted from the measured mean fluorescence intensity (MFU) to absolute quantity (mr) in pg by five-parameter logistic regression to a recombinant protein standard. Subsequently, measurements were converted to receptor concentration (r, molecules/cell) through the following relationship:1\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
